{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"微分分次代数"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"微分分次代数"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>域 $k$ 上的微分分次代数 (differential graded algebra, dg algebra) 是 $k$-"},{"Local":{"url":"链复形","text":"链复形"}},{"Plain":"的 $1$-范畴中的"},{"Local":{"url":"结合代数","text":"结合代数"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p>另见 "},{"Local":{"url":"A∞-代数","text":"$A_\\infty$-代数"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h3>传统</h3>\n<p>…</p>\n"}]}}